{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude97 Drive Me Broke \u2013 Coming Soon! \ud83c\udfc1</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s time to build your dream machine!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf56 Survive </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270a <strong>Gain Reputation</strong> by completing jobs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Earn Money</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Build Your Car</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Win Races</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>BECOME A LEGEND!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude98 Deep Car Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>100+ Detailed Parts:</strong> Every nut and bolt counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Custom Bodykits:</strong> Design your unique look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f <strong>Realistic Physics:</strong> Experience true-to-life driving and handling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Spray Painting:</strong> Wide range of colors to match your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udede <strong>9+ Wheel Styles:</strong> Find the perfect stance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude91 <strong>Interior Tuning:</strong> Various steering wheels and racing seats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>But remember...</strong> everything has a price!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddcd Survival &amp; World Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf56 <strong>Vitals:</strong> Manage Hunger, \ud83d\udca7 Thirst, \ud83d\ude34 Fatigue, and \u2764\ufe0f Will to Live.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1e <strong>Dynamic World:</strong> Full Day/Night cycle &amp; \ud83c\udf27\ufe0f changing weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>50+ Quests:</strong> Deepen your journey with various missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Interactive NPCs:</strong> Meet over 10 unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe2 <strong>Explore:</strong> 5-10 interactive buildings and landmarks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f <strong>The Track:</strong> Push your limits at the dedicated racing circuit.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbc Ways to Make Cash</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Farming:</strong> Grow vegetables and fruits for profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf77 <strong>Moonshining:</strong> Produce and smuggle wine for high stakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Towing Service:</strong> Help (or clear) the streets with your tow truck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc14 <strong>Poultry Farming:</strong> Raise chickens to stabilize your income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267b\ufe0f <strong>Scrapping:</strong> Turn trash into treasure through recycling.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...and much more coming in future updates!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Keep your reputation high! Building good relationships with NPCs can lead to unexpected favors and secret rewards. \ud83e\udd1d\u2728</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958820?t=1772502630","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958820?t=1772502630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958820/fae9e34d521642ed0bcb9794034de0984ae69c66/capsule_231x87.jpg